TICKET-104: Summarization & categorization pipeline

Priority: P0 · Estimate: 5 pts · Depends on: 103
LLM pipeline that buckets emails and produces short Amharic summaries.

Tasks

- Categories: `Important`, `Bills & Accounts`, `Family & Personal`, `Promotions/Other`
- One LLM call per digest batch (not per email) — pass N emails, request structured JSON out (category + 1-2 sentence Amharic summary + urgency flag per email). Validate JSON with a schema; retry once on parse failure
- Cache results in Firestore keyed by `messageId` — never re-summarize the same email (cost efficiency)
- Prompt versioning: store prompt template + version in repo; log version with each result
- Guard: total input tokens capped per digest; overflow emails get category-only treatment via cheap heuristics (sender domain lists)

Acceptance criteria

- Cost per daily digest ≤ $0.05 at 50 emails/day (measure and document)
- Malformed LLM output never reaches the client (schema-validated)
- Golden-file tests: fixed email fixtures → assert category correctness
